WEBVTT

00:12.012 --> 00:14.681
HYEONJUNG ELEMENTARY SCHOOL
YEAR 1, CLASS 3

00:30.196 --> 00:31.489
YOON SE-A

00:31.573 --> 00:32.949
KIM U-JIN

00:33.033 --> 00:37.704
WE DO NOT CLIMB ON THE WINDOWS!

00:41.833 --> 00:44.669
OUR DREAMS

00:52.052 --> 00:54.804
OUR AMAZING HAND TREE

01:12.739 --> 01:17.744
HOME OF THE HEART

01:19.996 --> 01:20.997
Mom.

01:22.290 --> 01:23.458
I'm sorry.

01:25.960 --> 01:27.837
I want to live.

01:29.422 --> 01:31.591
But to live, I think I need to die.

01:34.385 --> 01:36.387
You'll understand if you read my diary.

01:41.184 --> 01:42.185
Mom.

01:44.312 --> 01:46.022
Don't ever forgive that person.

02:25.186 --> 02:26.312
Ms. Choi Ji-seon?

02:28.690 --> 02:30.400
You must not have heard.

02:30.483 --> 02:33.069
The teachers have
a psychological evaluation today.

02:33.653 --> 02:36.698
It's almost time.
Please head over to the exam room.

02:46.416 --> 02:48.001
You must have been tidying up.

02:51.629 --> 02:52.630
Yes.

03:16.237 --> 03:20.033
All elementary school teachers nationwide
will be taking part in this evaluation.

03:20.116 --> 03:23.286
The outcome will not result
in any disadvantages.

03:23.369 --> 03:25.955
So please complete it honestly.

03:28.082 --> 03:30.126
3. I'M DOING RELATIVELY WELL
NOT AT ALL

03:33.546 --> 03:35.590
Have you been
to the Korean medicine clinic?

03:37.217 --> 03:38.051
Pardon?

03:39.177 --> 03:40.428
About your face.

03:41.262 --> 03:43.139
It seems to have gotten worse.

03:45.225 --> 03:46.643
Ms. Choi.

03:47.143 --> 03:51.481
Following your psychological evaluation,
you will not be teaching from tomorrow.

03:52.857 --> 03:54.359
You said no disadvantages.

03:55.318 --> 03:57.779
There isn't a single
elementary school teacher

03:57.862 --> 04:00.198
who hasn't dealt with
stress or depression.

04:00.281 --> 04:03.326
You're basically telling her
to give up on being a teacher.

04:04.285 --> 04:05.328
But still,

04:05.411 --> 04:07.413
wouldn't it be better than dying?

04:15.713 --> 04:19.384
Ms. Choi, you will take
a temporary leave of absence

04:21.010 --> 04:22.679
as ordered by the ERPB.

04:29.352 --> 04:31.813
LET'S BECOME A GOOD TEACHER!

04:34.232 --> 04:35.942
TOMORROW I'LL MEET THE CHILDREN

04:36.025 --> 04:38.236
My daughter
is an elementary school teacher.

04:38.319 --> 04:39.529
UPHOLD U-JIN'S SELF-ESTEEM

04:39.612 --> 04:41.281
I was scared for her.

04:41.781 --> 04:45.368
These kinds of things were written
in her diary.

04:47.245 --> 04:50.290
Please save my daughter.

04:57.046 --> 05:01.134
WILL IT END IF I DIE?

05:01.217 --> 05:06.014
TEACH YOU A LESSON

05:06.097 --> 05:08.266
HYEONJUNG ELEMENTARY SCHOOL

05:08.349 --> 05:11.602
What will happen to me now?

05:12.103 --> 05:13.896
You need to get treatment first.

05:13.980 --> 05:16.274
Your mother

05:16.357 --> 05:20.236
brought your things in earlier.

05:20.320 --> 05:23.114
Does my mom know… about this too?

05:23.698 --> 05:26.367
Your mother came to the ERPB.

05:27.785 --> 05:31.748
The best thing you can do for your mother
is to get good treatment.

05:31.831 --> 05:32.957
Shall we?

05:35.001 --> 05:38.629
Do you know what will happen
to my class and my students?

05:38.713 --> 05:41.966
Another teacher will take over from you.

05:42.050 --> 05:44.552
No, they can't.
Like me, that teacher will also--

05:44.635 --> 05:46.971
You don't have to worry about that.

05:47.055 --> 05:49.807
The new teacher

05:50.350 --> 05:52.518
is extremely terrifying.

06:06.574 --> 06:08.242
NA HWA-JIN

06:08.326 --> 06:10.119
Everyone, shall we sit down?

06:11.162 --> 06:12.830
Attention!

06:12.914 --> 06:15.375
Kids, now's not the time for tag.

06:16.793 --> 06:17.919
Quiet!

06:21.506 --> 06:23.007
Class!

06:30.598 --> 06:31.682
Sir!

06:32.266 --> 06:36.229
If you and our tae kwon do master
got into a fight, who would win?

06:36.312 --> 06:38.272
Sir, can you beat Naruto?

06:38.356 --> 06:40.483
Sir, I need to use the bathroom.

06:40.566 --> 06:41.901
It's not bathroom time now.

06:41.984 --> 06:42.902
Sir.

06:42.985 --> 06:45.446
-I told you to wait, didn't I?
-Bathroom, sir.

06:45.530 --> 06:46.906
What's wrong? Huh?

06:46.989 --> 06:48.616
No, not your pants. Wait!

06:56.791 --> 06:57.708
Sir.

06:58.751 --> 06:59.961
Bathroom.

07:05.758 --> 07:07.051
Me too!

07:09.720 --> 07:11.139
Super fun!

07:12.181 --> 07:14.559
Yay, so fun!

07:15.852 --> 07:17.770
You should have gyeran-mari for protein.

07:17.854 --> 07:19.188
-Don't you want it?
-Tomatoes.

07:20.231 --> 07:21.524
Not a fan of tomatoes?

07:26.571 --> 07:27.738
Mr. Na.

07:27.822 --> 07:28.948
Yes.

07:29.031 --> 07:30.032
Please fold me a frog.

07:30.116 --> 07:33.119
It's not time to fold frogs.
Just do what I asked you to do.

07:33.202 --> 07:34.912
Please fold one for me.

07:34.996 --> 07:37.999
It's not time for frogs right now.
Just do as you're told.

07:43.588 --> 07:45.339
No, I wasn't mad at you.

07:45.840 --> 07:47.758
We flip this over again.

07:50.344 --> 07:52.513
Okay, just like this.

07:53.055 --> 07:55.558
It's the shape of a frog's back legs.

07:55.641 --> 07:57.894
Yeon-seo, have you tried frog legs before?

07:57.977 --> 08:00.104
Yuck. Do people eat frog legs?

08:00.188 --> 08:01.814
I've tried them before.

08:01.898 --> 08:04.525
The frog is done!

08:04.609 --> 08:06.486
Hop! Wow.

08:06.569 --> 08:08.654
Make one for me too, please!

08:29.300 --> 08:30.301
Ga-yun.

08:30.801 --> 08:33.054
Was being a teacher this hard?

08:37.767 --> 08:40.269
Those damn frogs. I had to…

08:52.406 --> 08:53.824
LET'S BECOME A GOOD TEACHER!

08:53.908 --> 08:58.162
Today, we're going to learn
how to express our feelings with words.

08:58.246 --> 09:02.166
What do you say when you're feeling happy?

09:03.751 --> 09:04.627
That's right.

09:04.710 --> 09:07.338
"I'm in a good mood. I'm so happy."

09:07.964 --> 09:10.967
Just like this, we need to be able
to put our feelings into words.

09:11.050 --> 09:15.137
You always have to tell me
how you're feeling.

09:15.221 --> 09:16.264
Okay?

09:16.347 --> 09:19.684
It's nice to meet you. My name is…

09:24.105 --> 09:26.524
CHOI JI-SEON

09:31.654 --> 09:32.738
Class!

09:32.822 --> 09:34.615
It's nice to meet you.

09:34.699 --> 09:37.785
My name is Choi Ji-seon.

09:40.496 --> 09:42.540
I hope we can get along well.

09:42.623 --> 09:44.083
You know who I am now, right?

09:44.667 --> 09:48.129
Can you please
introduce yourselves to me too?

09:48.212 --> 09:50.298
Yes!

09:50.381 --> 09:51.215
You can start.

09:52.592 --> 09:54.802
I am Kim Yong-hun.

09:57.305 --> 09:58.556
I am Lee Yeon-seo.

10:13.988 --> 10:15.239
You're Kim U-jin, right?

10:16.032 --> 10:17.366
It's all right. Take a seat.

10:18.784 --> 10:19.744
Applause.

10:23.039 --> 10:24.707
-Goodbye.
-Goodbye.

10:24.790 --> 10:27.376
-Bye. Thank you.
-Thank you.

10:27.460 --> 10:28.711
Take care, ma'am.

10:28.794 --> 10:30.087
See you tomorrow, U-jin.

10:30.171 --> 10:31.839
-Say goodbye, Hun.
-Goodbye.

10:32.423 --> 10:34.425
Please take good care of U-jin, Ms. Choi.

10:34.508 --> 10:36.802
I'll do my best.
You can trust me with him.

10:37.386 --> 10:41.641
If I have any questions or concerns
from time to time, may I contact you?

10:41.724 --> 10:42.933
Of course you can.

10:43.017 --> 10:45.811
If you install the Talk Mate app,
you can message or call me.

10:45.895 --> 10:49.190
Please contact me there.
The hours are from eight to six.

10:50.149 --> 10:52.068
You live in Stern Complex, don't you?

10:53.069 --> 10:54.487
Yes, I do.

10:55.905 --> 10:57.948
Thanks for today. Let's go, U-jin.

11:09.418 --> 11:12.963
This is U-jin's mom.
I have a small concern.

11:13.464 --> 11:17.968
When you told U-jin to sit earlier,
you spoke very sternly.

11:18.052 --> 11:22.306
I'm worried U-jin might think
you don't like him.

11:22.390 --> 11:24.892
I'll do my best to make sure
he doesn't feel that way.

11:30.189 --> 11:33.275
I'm just worried his self-esteem
might drop. You understand, right?

11:34.610 --> 11:35.444
Of course.

11:36.028 --> 11:39.573
Request for Kim U-jin.
Make sure his self-esteem isn't affected.

11:50.793 --> 11:52.461
You're not sure?

11:52.545 --> 11:54.088
Should I explain again?

11:55.214 --> 11:57.216
Ms. Choi, I want to do it.

11:57.299 --> 11:58.801
I can do it too!

11:58.884 --> 12:00.511
I can do it too!

12:00.594 --> 12:02.221
Quiet.

12:06.934 --> 12:07.768
It's all right.

12:13.190 --> 12:14.984
U-jin's self-esteem is falling,

12:15.067 --> 12:17.486
so don't make him do math
in front of the class.

12:20.614 --> 12:24.118
Please don't mark incorrect answers
with a slash on U-jin's spelling test.

12:24.201 --> 12:25.953
It's affecting his self-esteem.

12:28.080 --> 12:32.668
"Don't," "no," or "stop."
Please don't use these restrictive words.

12:34.336 --> 12:37.965
Please always take my child's side
in any conflicts with his peers.

12:38.048 --> 12:41.969
Please use an advisory or requesting tone
rather than a commanding one.

12:42.052 --> 12:45.181
When greeting, please don't make him bow
with his hands together.

12:45.264 --> 12:48.893
If he feels pressured to greet properly,
it will lower his self-esteem.

12:48.976 --> 12:52.062
Please don't scold children
for being noisy in the classroom.

12:52.146 --> 12:53.814
It will make them feel discouraged.

13:18.172 --> 13:19.423
-You're overreacting.
-Yeah.

13:19.507 --> 13:21.175
-It's Ji-seon.
-Ji-seon!

13:23.302 --> 13:24.970
-I've missed you.
-It's been so long.

13:25.054 --> 13:25.888
Ji-seon.

13:29.642 --> 13:31.727
-Congratulations!
-When is the wedding?

13:31.811 --> 13:33.938
-It's written in there. Take a look.
-Hold on.

13:34.021 --> 13:35.689
Won-ho can't seem to stop smiling.

13:35.773 --> 13:37.691
Please wear a strapless bra.

13:37.775 --> 13:40.444
It may negatively affect
the boys' sexual awareness.

13:40.528 --> 13:42.446
-Congratulations, Won-ho!
-Cheers!

13:42.530 --> 13:44.782
Cheers!

14:00.422 --> 14:03.968
Why would you post something shameful
when the children might see it?

14:04.051 --> 14:06.637
I'm afraid it might provoke
their sexual curiosity.

14:11.225 --> 14:13.769
How did she find my Instagram?

14:13.853 --> 14:16.522
You always seem to be out.
Don't you think of the children?

14:16.605 --> 14:18.941
You spend your tax-funded salary
on having fun.

14:19.024 --> 14:21.277
Please invest in preparing for class too.

14:21.360 --> 14:24.071
I'd tolerate it
if it were at least about children.

14:24.572 --> 14:27.366
But I think she's gone too far.
It's strictly personal.

14:28.868 --> 14:31.036
Change your account username.

14:31.120 --> 14:33.539
Actually, it'd be even better
if you didn't use it.

14:33.622 --> 14:35.791
Why should I?
I haven't done anything wrong.

14:35.875 --> 14:38.460
I tried to take action at first too.

14:38.544 --> 14:40.754
I tried pressing charges
and persuading them.

14:40.838 --> 14:43.465
But in the end,
all I got was a group petition

14:43.549 --> 14:45.593
claiming I sided only with the teachers.

14:46.594 --> 14:48.846
No matter what I said,
they wouldn't listen.

14:48.929 --> 14:51.348
And no matter what I did,
they saw it negatively.

14:51.432 --> 14:53.475
In the end, they shook up

14:53.976 --> 14:55.269
the whole school.

15:02.026 --> 15:03.777
REMOVE "INSTAGRAM"?
DELETE APP

15:04.278 --> 15:05.696
DELETE "INSTAGRAM"?
DELETE

15:12.244 --> 15:15.247
I'll use Instagram when I retire.

15:15.748 --> 15:18.709
I have the children to consider.

16:15.933 --> 16:18.227
HOME OF THE HEART

16:52.928 --> 16:53.762
U-jin.

16:55.556 --> 16:58.475
This is your Home of the Heart.

16:58.559 --> 17:00.728
You can have fun with your friends here.

17:06.358 --> 17:08.110
How do you feel?

17:08.610 --> 17:10.446
What do you look for in a friend?

17:11.905 --> 17:13.949
I want to have fun together.

17:14.450 --> 17:15.451
Right?

17:15.534 --> 17:19.580
Since this is Home of the Heart,
you can do whatever your heart tells you.

17:20.080 --> 17:21.331
Should we try to do

17:21.874 --> 17:23.834
what your heart is telling you?

17:28.255 --> 17:29.673
Oh, it's the back.

17:32.885 --> 17:34.636
Yes!

17:35.512 --> 17:36.638
Here's water.

17:36.722 --> 17:37.848
Thanks.

17:43.395 --> 17:45.481
-Don't hurt yourself.
-Go, U-jin!

17:45.564 --> 17:46.523
Whoa!

17:49.109 --> 17:49.943
U-jin, well done!

17:50.027 --> 17:51.070
Yeah!

17:51.153 --> 17:52.362
Over here. Pass!

17:53.572 --> 17:55.824
Eun-ho kicks the ball.

17:55.908 --> 17:57.284
Over here. Pass!

17:57.993 --> 17:59.244
U-jin, pass!

18:01.246 --> 18:02.539
Hey, it went in.

18:03.707 --> 18:05.709
U-jin, I'm sorry.

18:08.212 --> 18:10.214
-Kim U-jin!
-"Don't," "no," or "stop."

18:10.297 --> 18:12.674
Please don't use these restrictive words.

18:13.175 --> 18:16.804
Please always take my child's side
in any conflicts with his peers.

18:18.806 --> 18:20.933
That hurts.

18:21.016 --> 18:22.059
Mommy.

18:22.142 --> 18:23.435
U-jin!

18:25.229 --> 18:31.026
Mommy!

18:31.777 --> 18:34.113
-It hurts.
-Seo-jun, are you okay?

18:34.863 --> 18:36.907
Mommy.

18:39.952 --> 18:41.453
Ladies.

18:42.371 --> 18:44.039
I'm sure you were alarmed.

18:44.540 --> 18:45.999
Please have some tea first.

18:54.800 --> 18:58.387
Seo-jun briefly told me what happened.

18:59.221 --> 19:02.432
They're boys, and when they play sports,

19:04.059 --> 19:05.519
they can get into fights.

19:05.602 --> 19:06.478
I understand.

19:06.562 --> 19:08.981
Thank you for understanding.

19:09.064 --> 19:12.151
The children apologized
to each other and made up.

19:13.402 --> 19:15.279
Did you make U-jin apologize?

19:21.201 --> 19:23.745
He did something wrong.
Of course he has to apologize.

19:23.829 --> 19:27.457
U-jin told me Seo-jun pushed him first.

19:27.958 --> 19:30.419
Since Seo-jun started it,
only he should apologize.

19:32.963 --> 19:34.006
Ma'am.

19:34.840 --> 19:36.633
Seo-jun injured his eye.

19:36.717 --> 19:38.427
He almost went blind.

19:38.510 --> 19:40.596
U-jin was also hurt.

19:40.679 --> 19:43.640
He was so upset
that he came home and cried.

19:43.724 --> 19:46.101
You have a strange way of putting things.

19:46.185 --> 19:49.021
Can't you see I'm trying to let it go
for our kids' sake?

19:49.104 --> 19:50.814
My child's feelings got hurt!

19:51.440 --> 19:53.650
What will you do if he's traumatized?

19:53.734 --> 19:56.904
He'd better not be.
I won't let your son get away with it.

19:56.987 --> 19:58.947
-What?
-Ladies.

19:59.031 --> 20:00.616
Please stop, and let's calm down.

20:00.699 --> 20:03.076
Ms. Choi, please say something.

20:03.160 --> 20:06.914
I heard U-jin couldn't even get along
with others in the beginning.

20:06.997 --> 20:09.124
Now I can see why.

20:09.208 --> 20:10.459
-Hey!
-"Hey"?

20:10.959 --> 20:13.795
Convene the School Violence Committee.
Try mouthing off there.

20:13.879 --> 20:15.672
All right. Fine!

20:15.756 --> 20:17.090
Bring it on. Convene it!

20:17.174 --> 20:21.303
Ladies, please calm down.
I'm begging you. Please calm down.

20:21.970 --> 20:22.804
Ma'am.

20:23.305 --> 20:26.892
I feel a School Violence Committee meeting
would be unfavorable for U-jin.

20:26.975 --> 20:28.143
Why don't we all just--

20:28.227 --> 20:30.812
Things have been blown out of proportion
because of you.

20:32.314 --> 20:35.692
I told you to take U-jin's side
in any conflicts with his peers,

20:35.776 --> 20:37.194
and you agreed to it.

20:37.903 --> 20:39.863
I never agreed to it.

20:41.531 --> 20:42.449
Pardon me?

20:43.533 --> 20:47.246
Why claim now you never agreed
when you were silent back then?

20:47.955 --> 20:50.123
I will speak to Seo-jun's mother--

20:50.207 --> 20:51.959
How will you testify at the meeting?

20:54.753 --> 20:55.921
Well…

20:57.339 --> 20:59.758
-I'll have to tell them what I saw.
-Right.

21:00.884 --> 21:02.302
So what did you see?

21:09.393 --> 21:10.560
Give me your number.

21:10.644 --> 21:13.355
It's against policy
to give out our personal phone numbers.

21:13.438 --> 21:15.857
-On Talk Mate--
-I can't call you there after work.

21:15.941 --> 21:18.318
You still want to enjoy
your post-work life

21:18.402 --> 21:20.362
after getting my child into trouble?

21:20.445 --> 21:21.655
That's not what I mean.

21:21.738 --> 21:22.990
Give it to me!

21:31.206 --> 21:33.166
This is all your fault.

21:34.376 --> 21:35.502
Do you know what?

21:36.003 --> 21:38.588
My husband is furious about this.

21:39.089 --> 21:41.758
Should I call him right now? Should I?

21:43.260 --> 21:44.428
Ma'am.

21:45.470 --> 21:48.432
A homeroom teacher
cannot help you in that way.

22:05.532 --> 22:06.366
Hello?

22:06.450 --> 22:07.743
This is U-jin's mom.

22:08.744 --> 22:09.745
Ma'am.

22:10.537 --> 22:12.289
How did you get my number?

22:12.372 --> 22:15.792
Is that important right now?
What are you going to do at the meeting?

22:18.003 --> 22:19.379
Hello? Answer me.

22:19.463 --> 22:20.380
Well…

22:20.464 --> 22:22.090
U-JIN'S MOTHER

22:31.933 --> 22:32.893
Hello?

22:33.393 --> 22:34.227
Ms. Choi!

22:34.311 --> 22:35.520
Hello?

22:35.604 --> 22:37.898
Why did you take so long to answer?

22:38.899 --> 22:39.900
Hello?

22:42.152 --> 22:43.653
I'm sorry.

22:43.737 --> 22:45.364
U-JIN'S MOTHER

22:47.532 --> 22:48.742
Are you listening to me?

22:49.493 --> 22:50.952
Why aren't you answering me?

22:51.036 --> 22:54.081
I'm planning my lessons at the moment.

22:55.457 --> 22:56.625
U-JIN'S MOTHER

23:06.426 --> 23:08.637
U-JIN'S MOTHER

23:10.722 --> 23:11.973
U-JIN'S MOTHER

23:13.934 --> 23:16.853
I told you to take U-jin's side
in any conflicts with his peers,

23:16.937 --> 23:18.021
and you agreed to it.

23:18.105 --> 23:20.357
You still want to enjoy
your post-work life

23:20.440 --> 23:22.526
after getting my child into trouble?

23:24.611 --> 23:25.487
U-JIN'S MOTHER

23:25.570 --> 23:27.489
This is all your fault.

23:27.572 --> 23:30.158
And you agreed to it.

23:31.076 --> 23:32.077
Ms. Choi?

23:33.078 --> 23:34.162
Ms. Choi?

23:39.751 --> 23:41.461
This is all your fault.

23:41.545 --> 23:45.549
This is all your fault now.

23:45.632 --> 23:47.926
Ms. Choi!

24:05.569 --> 24:06.820
Ms. Choi.

24:06.903 --> 24:09.030
Why aren't you answering your phone?

24:09.114 --> 24:10.991
Are you avoiding me out of guilt?

24:11.741 --> 24:13.452
Let's talk in person.

24:13.535 --> 24:14.536
-Okay?
-Who is it?

24:17.789 --> 24:19.791
I'm just going out for a moment.

24:19.875 --> 24:20.792
Where to?

24:22.961 --> 24:24.296
Where are you going?

24:25.505 --> 24:27.716
This is absurd.
How is U-jin the perpetrator?

24:28.467 --> 24:29.384
It's unacceptable.

24:29.468 --> 24:31.887
Why did the School Violence Committee
rule against us?

24:32.637 --> 24:34.181
It's Level 1 disciplinary action.

24:34.264 --> 24:36.516
All you need to do
is submit a written apology.

24:36.600 --> 24:38.059
It was you, wasn't it?

24:38.560 --> 24:40.896
-Pardon?
-You took their side, didn't you?

24:41.938 --> 24:43.815
You're mistaken. I didn't side with--

24:43.899 --> 24:45.984
Just because I said a few things,

24:46.067 --> 24:48.320
you went after U-jin out of spite,
didn't you?

24:52.782 --> 24:55.869
You don't deserve to be a teacher.

24:57.162 --> 24:59.789
I can't trust you with U-jin anymore,
so just quit.

24:59.873 --> 25:02.417
My husband is also enraged,

25:02.918 --> 25:04.336
so watch out.

25:37.702 --> 25:38.537
Dad?

25:50.173 --> 25:51.383
U-jin, come with me.

25:53.343 --> 25:54.553
Come on, Kim U-jin.

25:59.516 --> 26:00.517
I said come with me!

26:01.434 --> 26:03.770
We're in class right now.
If you come back later…

26:08.817 --> 26:11.403
Please don't do this. Think of U-jin.

26:16.700 --> 26:18.118
For God's sake.

26:18.785 --> 26:20.287
How pathetic. Seriously.

26:23.498 --> 26:24.332
Let's go.

26:25.166 --> 26:26.001
Move.

26:33.258 --> 26:34.509
Everyone, it's all right.

26:37.137 --> 26:38.763
It's okay, Ji-yeong. Don't cry.

26:45.353 --> 26:49.274
TEACHERS' RIGHTS PROTECTION COMMITTEE
NOTICE TO ATTEND

26:54.946 --> 26:56.364
Do it if you want to.

26:56.865 --> 27:00.285
Even if I violated teachers' rights,
all I have to do is apologize.

27:00.785 --> 27:02.454
Call a meeting on teachers' rights.

27:05.081 --> 27:08.126
I couldn't just sit back
when you abused your power.

27:12.547 --> 27:14.549
So I reported you for child abuse.

27:17.761 --> 27:20.722
You targeted U-jin,
humiliating him in front of others.

27:20.805 --> 27:24.267
And when I challenged this,
you gaslit a student to ostracize him.

27:24.351 --> 27:27.187
You lured him to a storage room
you call Home of the Heart

27:27.270 --> 27:28.647
and did unspeakable things--

27:28.730 --> 27:31.149
Ma'am, none of this is true.

27:31.232 --> 27:33.610
It's up to the police to look into that.

27:33.693 --> 27:36.446
Ma'am, I have never
emotionally abused a child.

27:38.073 --> 27:41.660
Do you think I made up a story
just to screw you over?

27:42.786 --> 27:44.788
What about how wronged U-jin feels?

27:45.580 --> 27:49.250
If you're innocent,
then why is U-jin crying at home?

27:49.334 --> 27:51.294
I feel for U-jin,

27:51.961 --> 27:53.171
but this isn't right.

27:53.254 --> 27:55.590
So why is the teacher
not taking responsibility

27:55.674 --> 27:57.717
when a student has been wronged?

27:57.801 --> 27:59.511
Is it my resignation

28:00.011 --> 28:01.346
that you want?

28:02.263 --> 28:04.099
I also consulted a lawyer.

28:04.182 --> 28:06.309
The law has changed.
Even if you report me,

28:06.810 --> 28:09.437
I won't be suspended immediately
like before.

28:09.521 --> 28:10.980
Who said anything about that?

28:11.481 --> 28:12.482
Teach your class.

28:12.565 --> 28:15.318
When you're done,
give your statement to the police.

28:16.027 --> 28:18.488
Reaching a verdict
will take six months to a year.

28:18.571 --> 28:20.240
It'll take longer than you think.

28:20.740 --> 28:22.450
If you can't handle it, you can quit.

28:29.708 --> 28:32.460
If I'm found innocent,
what will you do then?

28:37.090 --> 28:38.717
Then I'll have to apologize.

28:39.759 --> 28:40.885
That's all.

28:41.386 --> 28:42.762
That's the law.

29:19.132 --> 29:20.175
Ms. Choi.

29:20.258 --> 29:23.344
This came up on a moms' forum.
Have you seen it?

29:23.428 --> 29:25.638
It seems quite serious.

29:26.848 --> 29:29.642
1-3 HOMEROOM TEACHER
AT HYEONJUNG ELEMENTARY IS A CHILD ABUSER

29:32.103 --> 29:33.605
LOOKS CAN BE DECEIVING
SO SHOCKING

29:35.732 --> 29:38.485
PLEASE SHARE THIS POST UNTIL THE DAY
CHOI JI-SEON IS PUNISHED

29:38.568 --> 29:39.611
MS. CHOI 010-0235-7462

29:50.622 --> 29:53.708
All right. Year 1, class 3,
please come in.

29:55.877 --> 29:56.795
Let's go, class.

30:02.967 --> 30:04.135
Have a watermelon slice.

30:10.683 --> 30:12.477
Is that all the rice you're having?

30:12.977 --> 30:15.063
Is that okay? Enjoy your meal.

30:16.981 --> 30:17.816
Scissors.

30:18.775 --> 30:20.568
Scissors, scissors, rock.

30:21.820 --> 30:24.364
We keep getting complaint calls.

30:25.281 --> 30:27.826
Many parents are coming in person too.

30:28.743 --> 30:30.578
They say if we let you come to work,

30:31.329 --> 30:33.498
they won't send their children to school.

30:36.000 --> 30:37.293
I'm sorry

30:37.794 --> 30:40.129
I can't tell you to hold out.

31:20.169 --> 31:22.171
TEACHER
KIM U-JIN

31:26.009 --> 31:28.219
KIDDOS IN YEAR 1, CLASS 3

31:28.303 --> 31:29.721
KIM U-JIN: THOUGHTFUL, SMILEY

31:29.804 --> 31:31.139
KIM YUN-U: VERY CONSIDERATE

31:36.519 --> 31:39.647
MS. CHOI, BE HAPPY

31:43.401 --> 31:46.362
She would've felt like
she was standing all alone in a jungle.

31:46.446 --> 31:48.531
IT'S HARD TO OPEN MY EYES IN THE MORNING

31:49.115 --> 31:50.867
Eyes were on her from all sides,

31:51.367 --> 31:54.203
with people ready to pounce on her.

31:55.747 --> 31:57.624
There was no one or weapon to help her.

31:57.707 --> 31:59.417
I'M MAKING MY OWN STUDENTS UNHAPPY

31:59.500 --> 32:00.335
WILL IT END IF I DIE?

32:00.418 --> 32:02.253
Why are the police investigating this?

32:02.337 --> 32:04.839
It's all perfectly reasonable
and legitimate guidance.

32:05.423 --> 32:08.009
The police have to investigate
since a report was filed.

32:08.092 --> 32:10.595
Can they report it
when it's clearly unreasonable?

32:10.678 --> 32:12.138
Yes, they can.

32:12.221 --> 32:13.348
They can?

32:13.431 --> 32:16.434
For child abuse, you can file a report
based solely on suspicion.

32:18.686 --> 32:19.938
As you can see,

32:20.021 --> 32:24.817
11,626 teachers
have been reported for child abuse

32:24.901 --> 32:27.362
over the past several years.

32:27.445 --> 32:30.281
But only 1.6% of them

32:30.365 --> 32:32.075
were actually prosecuted.

32:32.951 --> 32:37.622
This means most of the teachers suffered
because of the reports,

32:38.247 --> 32:41.292
even though their guidance was legitimate.

32:41.376 --> 32:44.212
Since you can report
based on suspicion alone,

32:44.712 --> 32:48.007
you won't be punished
for a false accusation

32:48.091 --> 32:49.926
even if the accused is found innocent.

32:50.468 --> 32:52.387
That's what the parents are abusing.

32:52.470 --> 32:53.888
They press charges first,

32:54.764 --> 32:56.933
and if the verdict is innocent,
they dismiss it.

32:57.016 --> 32:58.142
Damn it.

32:58.226 --> 33:02.981
Emotional abuse is difficult to define
under current child abuse laws

33:03.064 --> 33:04.941
because the harm isn't visible.

33:06.275 --> 33:08.403
You can only rely on what the parents say.

33:08.486 --> 33:10.863
It's difficult for teachers
to prove it's not abuse.

33:10.947 --> 33:12.949
And they get worn down alone.

33:13.032 --> 33:15.284
Most of them will be found innocent,

33:15.368 --> 33:17.954
but until then,
they have to be investigated

33:18.037 --> 33:20.415
and, in some cases,
be removed from their class.

33:20.498 --> 33:24.752
Teachers are told not to hit, even gently,
yet parents are effectively handed guns.

33:24.836 --> 33:27.839
What are teachers supposed
to block the bullets with?

33:27.922 --> 33:29.257
Seriously!

33:30.049 --> 33:30.883
Damn it.

33:31.384 --> 33:32.427
In the current system,

33:33.052 --> 33:36.806
if teachers are reported for child abuse,

33:36.889 --> 33:38.933
there's basically no shield
to protect them.

33:43.771 --> 33:44.897
We can be

33:45.815 --> 33:47.025
their shield.

33:47.692 --> 33:49.068
Although it will be difficult,

33:50.153 --> 33:51.195
we'll go step by step.

33:52.447 --> 33:53.573
That's what we'll do.

33:55.158 --> 33:56.409
So, Na Hwa-jin.

33:56.492 --> 34:00.371
You just handle the power-abusing parents
hiding behind the law.

34:12.800 --> 34:14.677
I'm getting all fired up to fight.

34:14.761 --> 34:16.054
You've got this!

34:16.137 --> 34:20.183
"You just handle the power-abusing parents
hiding behind the law."

34:24.771 --> 34:25.730
Ms. Choi Ji-seon.

34:26.230 --> 34:27.815
Please come this way.

34:27.899 --> 34:29.067
COUNSELING ROOM

34:31.319 --> 34:32.236
I'll see you soon.

34:42.997 --> 34:46.667
How can a person
harass someone to this extent?

34:46.751 --> 34:48.503
I think people are the scariest.

34:49.504 --> 34:53.341
Still, reptilians are a little scarier.

34:53.424 --> 34:54.258
Rep… what?

34:54.342 --> 34:58.137
There are actually aliens
who have infiltrated Earth right now.

34:58.221 --> 34:59.764
Aliens do not exist.

34:59.847 --> 35:02.892
They really do. There is various evidence
to show reptilian aliens--

35:02.975 --> 35:04.852
Seriously, you believe in strange things.

35:07.980 --> 35:11.859
Okay, fine. I'll stop talking now.

35:12.443 --> 35:13.986
Why?

35:14.070 --> 35:16.155
Do I not seem worth talking to anymore?

35:16.239 --> 35:19.617
It feels like my loss

35:19.700 --> 35:22.370
when I talk to people
who are a little ignorant.

35:22.954 --> 35:23.788
I see.

35:23.871 --> 35:25.623
Deputy Director Bong.

35:25.706 --> 35:26.541
Yes?

35:26.624 --> 35:28.334
-The rep…
-Reptilians.

35:29.001 --> 35:31.379
Right, the rep… whatever.

35:31.462 --> 35:32.839
Yes?

35:33.464 --> 35:36.050
Should I show you
that people are scarier than them?

35:36.759 --> 35:37.718
No…

35:43.683 --> 35:44.517
Look.

35:45.476 --> 35:48.855
I'll show you again how to write
the Chinese character for "patience."

35:48.938 --> 35:50.606
It starts with "do" for knife.

35:51.107 --> 35:52.483
Then "sim" for heart.

35:53.067 --> 35:54.777
Cut your heart with a knife.

35:55.486 --> 35:56.362
Try to…

36:20.094 --> 36:23.389
All right,
who would like to solve this problem?

36:23.472 --> 36:24.515
-Me!
-Me!

36:29.896 --> 36:31.063
U-jin, you can try.

36:35.860 --> 36:41.282
In math class, we solved problems
on the board with friends.

36:41.365 --> 36:42.909
Although we taught them,

36:42.992 --> 36:46.996
if anything still needs work,
please review it at home.

37:00.051 --> 37:01.177
Oh my God!

37:03.304 --> 37:04.305
Are you all right?

37:05.681 --> 37:08.434
-Let me help you.
-Why were you standing there?

37:08.517 --> 37:10.102
Well…

37:10.603 --> 37:14.523
This is my classroom,
and I'm the homeroom teacher.

37:15.942 --> 37:18.569
Are you U-jin's new homeroom teacher?

37:18.653 --> 37:20.529
You must be U-jin's mother.

37:21.113 --> 37:23.199
Hello, ma'am.

37:23.282 --> 37:25.785
I'm Na Hwa-jin, U-jin's homeroom teacher.

37:25.868 --> 37:28.579
What brings you here
this early in the morning?

37:28.663 --> 37:31.499
Yesterday, you made U-jin
solve math problems, didn't you?

37:31.582 --> 37:33.876
Yes, but I was so surprised.

37:33.960 --> 37:36.796
How is U-jin so smart?

37:36.879 --> 37:39.340
He seems to have studied ahead.

37:39.423 --> 37:42.051
You had him study ahead a lot, didn't you?

37:42.134 --> 37:43.678
No, not really.

37:43.761 --> 37:46.430
Then he must be a natural.

37:46.514 --> 37:49.475
I wonder if U-jin takes after you.

37:49.976 --> 37:51.727
You did well in school, didn't you?

37:52.645 --> 37:54.230
-A little bit.
-I knew it.

37:54.313 --> 37:57.149
Ma'am, you look like you did.
You really do.

37:58.734 --> 38:03.281
By the way, from now on,
please don't make U-jin solve problems.

38:03.364 --> 38:05.658
If he doesn't know,
it could hurt his self-esteem.

38:06.242 --> 38:08.077
I didn't realize.

38:08.160 --> 38:10.538
I've learned something important
thanks to you.

38:11.455 --> 38:14.625
Seeing that we're on the same page,
I won't have to worry this time.

38:14.709 --> 38:16.460
What were you worried about, ma'am?

38:16.544 --> 38:18.963
The previous homeroom teacher
was really strange.

38:19.046 --> 38:22.174
Ma'am, I will make sure
I'm never like that.

38:23.009 --> 38:23.843
Thank you.

38:27.638 --> 38:28.472
NA HWA-JIN

38:29.432 --> 38:30.933
Yes, what can I do for you?

38:31.017 --> 38:33.936
U-jin keeps dozing off during class.

38:34.020 --> 38:35.563
What should I do about it?

38:35.646 --> 38:37.273
You can just wake him.

38:37.356 --> 38:39.650
Sleeping is a student's right.

38:39.734 --> 38:42.695
Would it be okay for me to violate it?

38:42.778 --> 38:44.405
I'll allow it. Just wake him up.

38:44.488 --> 38:45.823
Yes, ma'am.

38:46.949 --> 38:48.951
What would be the best way to wake U-jin?

38:49.035 --> 38:50.328
Just shake him awake.

38:50.411 --> 38:53.080
I could be accused of child abuse
if I touch him.

38:53.164 --> 38:55.416
Then you can just call him to wake him up.

38:55.499 --> 38:56.709
Right!

38:56.792 --> 38:57.668
NA HWA-JIN

38:57.752 --> 39:01.756
If U-jin is startled by the loud noise
and gets emotionally stressed,

39:01.839 --> 39:02.798
that can be abuse…

39:02.882 --> 39:04.717
Then tell his neighbor to wake him.

39:04.800 --> 39:07.011
What if that embarrasses him?

39:07.094 --> 39:08.929
Don't wake him, and just leave him be.

39:09.013 --> 39:12.183
Ma'am, that would be neglect.
Neglect is also a form of abuse.

39:14.727 --> 39:16.812
Hello? Ma'am?

39:17.563 --> 39:18.606
NA HWA-JIN

39:22.777 --> 39:23.986
For God's sake.

39:31.660 --> 39:32.828
Ma'am, it's me.

39:32.912 --> 39:37.500
When marking U-jin's spelling tests,
what should I use instead of a slash?

39:38.000 --> 39:39.668
There are so many options.

39:39.752 --> 39:41.087
You could use a star.

39:41.170 --> 39:44.256
But stars are used for important things.

39:44.340 --> 39:45.216
Or a triangle.

39:45.299 --> 39:48.803
That's for partially correct answers.

39:51.847 --> 39:52.681
A rhombus?

39:52.765 --> 39:53.682
A trapezoid.

39:54.183 --> 39:55.184
NA HWA-JIN

39:55.267 --> 39:56.227
Just…

39:58.187 --> 39:59.647
use a slash.

39:59.730 --> 40:01.482
Yes, ma'am. I'll call you again.

40:01.565 --> 40:02.817
Damn it.

40:03.859 --> 40:04.944
Goddamn it!

40:10.574 --> 40:11.992
What are your thoughts

40:12.076 --> 40:15.037
on parents contacting teachers

40:15.121 --> 40:16.956
on their personal numbers?

40:17.039 --> 40:21.252
I heard it has major implications
for teachers' rights and privacy.

40:21.335 --> 40:26.006
That's why we're running a pilot project
to provide work numbers for teachers.

40:26.090 --> 40:27.341
Will it be effective?

40:28.217 --> 40:29.927
Can parents actually be stopped

40:30.010 --> 40:34.265
from contacting teachers on social media,
via DMs, or even visiting their homes?

40:35.057 --> 40:38.144
We plan to set up
a complaints response team in each school

40:38.227 --> 40:41.522
to save teachers
from directly dealing with complaints.

40:41.605 --> 40:44.358
Are you saying it's fine for them
to deal with complaints?

40:44.859 --> 40:46.235
They're not punching bags.

40:46.318 --> 40:50.072
Passing complaints around
will only create another tragedy.

40:53.159 --> 40:56.245
You say you'll change the system
and find a solution

40:56.745 --> 40:59.039
every time a teacher dies at school.

40:59.123 --> 41:01.834
Then this should stop happening,
but why hasn't it?

41:01.917 --> 41:04.378
A system isn't something
you create after an incident.

41:04.462 --> 41:06.547
It's something you design
to prevent problems.

41:09.425 --> 41:11.135
Let's come up with a solution.

41:11.635 --> 41:14.555
If the law is needed,
I'll bring in the Minister of Justice.

41:14.638 --> 41:17.475
If power is needed,
I'll bring the president if I have to.

41:17.558 --> 41:18.601
Let's make sure

41:19.268 --> 41:21.187
no more teachers die

41:21.687 --> 41:23.105
because of complaints.

41:23.814 --> 41:24.857
Yes, sir.

41:38.120 --> 41:39.497
Ma'am!

41:39.580 --> 41:41.499
I was actually about to call you.

41:41.582 --> 41:44.710
When we wave to greet others,
we wave like this.

41:44.793 --> 41:47.963
Should I get the kids
to use their right hand or left hand?

41:48.047 --> 41:51.091
Waving is actually related
to the right and left sides of the brain.

41:51.175 --> 41:53.636
That's something
you can decide for yourself.

41:53.719 --> 41:56.889
What would a teacher know?
You would know better.

41:56.972 --> 41:59.391
Then what would teachers be at school for?

41:59.475 --> 42:01.810
I'll call you when I need to,
so please don't call.

42:02.770 --> 42:04.605
Then maybe I could DM you or--

42:04.688 --> 42:07.024
No, I'm telling you not to!

42:07.608 --> 42:09.777
-Yes, ma'am.
-And watch yourself.

42:10.277 --> 42:12.613
My husband is furious
about what happened yesterday.

42:12.696 --> 42:14.114
U-jin's father?

42:14.782 --> 42:16.534
Oh no. That shouldn't happen.

42:21.664 --> 42:23.874
Customer number 820.

42:24.583 --> 42:25.626
Yes.

42:25.709 --> 42:27.044
-Hello.
-Here.

42:27.127 --> 42:28.629
How can I help you?

42:28.712 --> 42:31.006
May I please speak to U-jin's father?

42:32.007 --> 42:33.008
Pardon?

42:34.009 --> 42:35.302
U-jin's father.

42:36.095 --> 42:37.555
U-jin's father.

42:38.055 --> 42:39.265
There's a second floor.

42:39.348 --> 42:41.183
U-jin's father!

42:41.267 --> 42:42.726
U-jin's fath…

42:47.106 --> 42:49.984
-Who are you?
-Do you happen to be U-jin's father?

42:50.818 --> 42:51.735
Yes, I am.

42:54.989 --> 42:58.033
Sir, I am very sorry.

42:58.117 --> 42:59.660
Please forgive me just this once.

42:59.743 --> 43:00.703
Please don't do this.

43:00.786 --> 43:04.331
I worked very hard
to become a teacher, sir.

43:05.291 --> 43:06.917
Are you U-jin's homeroom teacher?

43:07.001 --> 43:10.546
I heard you were extremely angry
because of what I did, sir.

43:10.629 --> 43:15.759
If you tell me what I did wrong,
I will make sure it never happens again.

43:16.760 --> 43:18.178
-Please just get up.
-Sir!

43:18.262 --> 43:20.347
Sir, is it because I put a slash

43:20.431 --> 43:22.850
through U-jin's wrong answers like this

43:23.350 --> 43:25.019
that you are so angry?

43:25.102 --> 43:26.312
If that's not it,

43:26.395 --> 43:30.524
is it because I used negative words
such as "no" and "don't" to U-jin?

43:30.608 --> 43:34.361
The last time you came to our school,
you almost hit the former teacher.

43:34.445 --> 43:36.739
It serves us right to get beaten up, sir.

43:36.822 --> 43:38.365
But you'll get me fired.

43:38.449 --> 43:40.701
Please don't take away my livelihood, sir.

43:41.869 --> 43:44.079
Sir, I'm begging you.

43:44.163 --> 43:46.373
-Let go of me.
-Gosh, please don't hit…

43:46.457 --> 43:47.666
-Oh my.
-What's with him?

43:48.667 --> 43:50.544
Sir, I am sorry.

43:51.211 --> 43:52.713
Sir, it's not what you think.

43:52.796 --> 43:53.964
Sir!

43:54.048 --> 43:56.133
Oh my God. How embarrassing.
What is he doing?

43:56.216 --> 43:57.676
-Seriously?
-Sir!

43:59.261 --> 44:00.095
Your pants, sir.

44:00.971 --> 44:02.181
-Pull your pants up.
-Damn.

44:02.264 --> 44:03.098
Wait.

44:03.849 --> 44:05.601
Do you have a death wish?

44:12.816 --> 44:14.610
Learn to control that temper of yours.

44:15.402 --> 44:18.947
If I ever hear anything
like "my husband is angry" again,

44:20.783 --> 44:21.742
then you're done for.

44:27.456 --> 44:28.540
Right then, sir.

44:29.041 --> 44:30.668
I'll get going now, sir.

44:33.003 --> 44:34.046
Damn it!

44:34.546 --> 44:37.466
That was embarrassing as hell!
Can't you even handle one teacher?

44:37.549 --> 44:38.967
How did I know he'd do that?

44:40.344 --> 44:43.180
I'm up for a promotion soon.
The manager saw everything. Now what?

44:43.263 --> 44:45.849
It was that teacher.
Why take it out on me?

44:45.933 --> 44:46.975
Damn you!

44:47.059 --> 44:48.268
You deal with this.

44:48.352 --> 44:50.562
Talk to the principal,
or file a complaint.

44:50.646 --> 44:52.064
Get the bastard fired now!

44:52.147 --> 44:53.232
Fine!

44:53.315 --> 44:54.483
Jesus.

44:55.192 --> 44:56.151
Damn it.

45:00.447 --> 45:02.783
-Hello.
-Hi, guys.

45:03.951 --> 45:05.994
-Hello.
-Bye, Mom.

45:06.078 --> 45:08.122
-Hi, children.
-Hello.

45:13.377 --> 45:15.754
Do you even train your teachers?

45:15.838 --> 45:18.215
Mr. Na caused a scene
at a parent's workplace!

45:18.298 --> 45:19.425
Do something.

45:23.721 --> 45:26.140
It's illegal for you to show up like this.

45:26.223 --> 45:28.726
If you would like to contact us,
use the app.

45:29.226 --> 45:32.604
And if you have a complaint,
please follow the proper procedure.

45:33.313 --> 45:34.815
If that's not enough,

45:34.898 --> 45:37.985
please use an online complaint board
at the Blue House,

45:38.068 --> 45:41.238
the Ministry of Education, or the ERPB.

45:41.822 --> 45:43.031
Ma'am.

45:43.115 --> 45:45.033
Do you think I don't know that already?

45:45.117 --> 45:48.454
Shall I tell you something else
you already know very well?

45:48.537 --> 45:50.789
U-jin may be your precious child,

45:51.832 --> 45:54.793
but the teachers are also

45:55.294 --> 45:57.254
someone's precious child.

46:01.508 --> 46:02.926
You're all

46:03.719 --> 46:05.137
out of your minds.

46:05.220 --> 46:07.890
You'll regret this. Just you wait.

46:18.317 --> 46:20.194
The ERPB will take responsibility

46:20.778 --> 46:22.488
and deal with any consequences.

46:22.571 --> 46:24.656
So when things like this happen,

46:25.240 --> 46:29.161
please be the teachers' mentor,
not their principal.

46:31.330 --> 46:34.541
Right now, the teachers need

46:34.625 --> 46:36.710
a mentor like you…

46:38.712 --> 46:40.506
more than they need the ERPB.

46:54.394 --> 46:55.437
He's right.

46:57.439 --> 46:58.732
We were their mentors.

47:02.152 --> 47:03.153
Sometimes,

47:04.571 --> 47:06.073
I seem to forget.

47:13.038 --> 47:14.498
What have you drawn here?

47:15.290 --> 47:16.834
U-jin, come with me.

47:17.501 --> 47:18.335
We're done here.

47:20.671 --> 47:21.713
Get up.

47:27.845 --> 47:28.929
Get up!

47:39.731 --> 47:41.149
Gather the parents for me.

47:41.233 --> 47:43.402
This is absurd.
I'll tell you when we meet.

47:51.702 --> 47:53.412
You're all here.

48:02.212 --> 48:03.922
Why are you here?

48:04.006 --> 48:05.507
Hello, ma'am.

48:06.049 --> 48:07.050
Well…

48:11.013 --> 48:12.639
I came to give you this.

48:13.223 --> 48:14.600
What is this?

48:14.683 --> 48:16.727
If you take a look…

48:17.978 --> 48:20.272
COMPLAINT
COMPLAINANT: NA HWA-JIN

48:20.355 --> 48:23.984
I filed a complaint against you
for child abuse.

48:24.067 --> 48:25.736
-Child abuse?
-Yes.

48:25.819 --> 48:27.195
I saw everything.

48:27.779 --> 48:29.907
U-jin didn't want to,

48:29.990 --> 48:31.909
but you grabbed him
and held him like this.

48:31.992 --> 48:35.913
When he was changing into his gym clothes,
he had bruises all over his body and--

48:35.996 --> 48:37.247
Where on my child's body

48:38.707 --> 48:40.208
are you saying there are bruises?

48:40.292 --> 48:43.754
Well, we'll find out
once the police investigate.

48:43.837 --> 48:46.840
What gives you the right
to report me, his parent?

48:46.924 --> 48:50.052
"When a teacher becomes aware of
or suspects child abuse

48:50.135 --> 48:53.013
in the course of performing their duties,

48:53.096 --> 48:55.015
the teacher shall immediately report it

48:55.098 --> 48:57.726
to a child protection agency
or an investigative agency."

48:58.685 --> 48:59.645
That's the law.

49:00.437 --> 49:01.813
What if it's not child abuse?

49:02.606 --> 49:04.066
Then I'll have to apologize.

49:05.525 --> 49:07.486
That's the law.

49:13.867 --> 49:17.287
I heard this mom
bullied Ms. Choi Ji-seon, didn't she?

49:17.371 --> 49:21.124
It was so bad, the teacher developed
partial facial paralysis.

49:21.708 --> 49:23.919
She's not well enough
to come to school now.

49:24.002 --> 49:25.379
-Really?
-I knew it.

49:25.462 --> 49:27.714
I heard she's been extreme
since kindergarten.

49:27.798 --> 49:29.591
No wonder the kid is odd.

49:29.675 --> 49:31.927
Yes, it's a relief
he's not in my child's class.

49:32.010 --> 49:33.553
-I know, right?
-Who said that?

49:34.054 --> 49:35.597
U-jin's mom.

49:35.681 --> 49:36.848
I asked who said that.

49:36.932 --> 49:39.601
No one said it. On the Internet, it…

49:39.685 --> 49:41.061
Was it that bitch, Ms. Choi?

49:43.105 --> 49:44.731
-I'm asking you!
-Oh my.

49:44.815 --> 49:46.858
Was it that bitch of a teacher,
Choi Ji-seon?

49:48.735 --> 49:49.695
So-yun.

49:49.778 --> 49:52.030
-Let's go.
-I'd better go too.

49:57.202 --> 50:00.539
U-JIN'S MOTHER

50:18.932 --> 50:20.392
Damn it.

50:21.601 --> 50:22.519
Damn it.

51:02.142 --> 51:03.727
Were you two in on it together?

51:05.771 --> 51:08.356
Don't you know U-jin is being left out
because of you?

51:08.440 --> 51:10.859
Why the hell is the teacher at fault?
That's on you.

51:10.942 --> 51:11.902
Excuse me?

51:11.985 --> 51:14.237
-Are you being rude to a parent right now?
-What?

51:14.321 --> 51:16.114
You're rude. Why can't I be?

51:17.783 --> 51:21.661
I'll report you and that bitch
to the Office of Education and the press.

51:21.745 --> 51:23.163
Oh, and the ERPB.

51:23.705 --> 51:25.290
My family works there.

51:25.874 --> 51:28.043
I'll see to it that you never teach again.

51:29.795 --> 51:31.254
Allow me to reintroduce myself.

51:32.547 --> 51:35.300
I'm Inspector Na Hwa-jin from the ERPB.

51:36.635 --> 51:39.721
I am well aware of what you did
to Ms. Choi.

51:39.805 --> 51:41.139
That's why we are here.

51:41.223 --> 51:42.307
Isn't this entrapment?

51:43.266 --> 51:44.976
Entrapment is illegal!

51:45.060 --> 51:46.812
You love the law, don't you?

51:46.895 --> 51:48.105
Shall we do it legally?

51:48.188 --> 51:50.440
The ERPB investigation finds you liable

51:50.524 --> 51:53.527
of criminal penalties
for malicious false complaints,

51:53.610 --> 51:55.237
violation of teachers' rights,

51:55.320 --> 51:57.239
obstruction of business, and insult.

51:57.322 --> 51:58.740
What did I do wrong?

51:58.824 --> 52:00.700
It was all for my child's sake.

52:00.784 --> 52:04.412
What kind of parent in the world
would just watch their child being harmed?

52:04.496 --> 52:06.790
It's all Choi's fault.

52:06.873 --> 52:08.834
What does she know about education
with no kids?

52:09.709 --> 52:11.711
How would she know how a parent feels?

52:14.673 --> 52:18.009
Then you'd know very well
how Ms. Choi's parents feel.

52:19.136 --> 52:23.140
How do you think her mother felt
watching her daughter suffer?

52:24.850 --> 52:25.684
I don't know.

52:26.184 --> 52:28.019
Who cares what happens to that bitch?

52:28.520 --> 52:29.980
Only my child matters to me.

52:30.564 --> 52:32.649
All the parents in the world are the same.

52:37.195 --> 52:39.865
Are you sure this looks like me?

52:40.490 --> 52:42.159
Are you? Wait.

52:42.242 --> 52:47.289
I don't think the skin tone
matches mine, U-jin.

52:48.540 --> 52:50.000
I'll draw too.

52:52.502 --> 52:53.461
U-jin.

52:54.880 --> 52:58.967
Why did you call me on your mom's phone?

52:59.467 --> 53:01.553
You told me

53:01.636 --> 53:03.972
I should do what my heart tells me.

53:04.723 --> 53:08.602
I was having a hard time,
so I wanted to see you.

53:12.272 --> 53:14.858
Why were you having a hard time?

53:18.236 --> 53:20.238
I'm sorry, Ms. Choi.

53:20.739 --> 53:23.575
My mom hurt you a lot, didn't she?

53:28.413 --> 53:29.497
U-jin.

53:31.666 --> 53:33.335
It's not up to you to apologize.

53:39.966 --> 53:42.594
HOME OF THE HEART

53:42.677 --> 53:44.846
Mom hates me.

53:45.513 --> 53:47.515
She doesn't smile at me

53:47.599 --> 53:49.601
and always looks angry.

53:53.855 --> 53:55.148
Come here, U-jin.

53:58.860 --> 54:02.405
You must have had a really tough time.

54:02.906 --> 54:04.032
It's okay.

54:05.116 --> 54:06.785
It's all right.

54:10.997 --> 54:12.207
You're okay.

54:21.049 --> 54:22.801
Do you feel a little better now?

54:25.136 --> 54:27.138
Shall we get back to coloring this in?

54:33.520 --> 54:35.981
Who do you think
truly cares for the child?

54:43.071 --> 54:46.199
What kind of adult
do you hope U-jin grows up to be?

54:47.075 --> 54:50.704
The kind who does not apologize,
even when he's wrong?

54:51.955 --> 54:55.875
The kind who lives a lonely life
with no friends or colleagues?

54:58.795 --> 55:03.049
The kind who treats others' lives
as worthless if it serves their own gain?

55:03.717 --> 55:05.302
That's not what you want.

55:06.219 --> 55:07.887
So please stop.

55:08.722 --> 55:10.473
Your child doesn't like it.

55:10.974 --> 55:12.892
He says he likes his teacher.

55:13.393 --> 55:14.769
Please trust U-jin

55:16.146 --> 55:17.897
and trust his teacher.

55:19.941 --> 55:23.028
Hey, you can't draw it like this.

55:24.237 --> 55:25.739
Do you think it looks like me?

55:26.906 --> 55:27.824
Do you?

55:27.907 --> 55:30.160
Why can't you answer me, U-jin?

55:30.952 --> 55:32.203
I think it looks like me.

55:32.287 --> 55:35.206
I'll be the rabbit. You be the bear.

55:41.254 --> 55:42.756
That's a great drawing.

55:47.552 --> 55:50.597
How did you know
Ms. Choi would come to the school?

55:50.680 --> 55:51.973
Because she's a teacher.

55:52.724 --> 55:54.517
School came to my mind first.

55:55.602 --> 55:57.645
I guess it was the same for Ms. Choi too.

55:57.729 --> 56:00.190
So you two were telepathic.

56:00.273 --> 56:01.983
Maybe.

56:02.817 --> 56:05.945
By any chance,
do you both know what telepathy is?

56:06.029 --> 56:08.239
Isn't it when you think the same
as someone else?

56:08.323 --> 56:10.283
No, it's not simply thinking the same.

56:10.367 --> 56:12.827
It's when a person's thoughts and actions

56:12.911 --> 56:15.747
are passed on to someone else.

56:15.830 --> 56:17.916
It's like a kind of superpower.

56:17.999 --> 56:20.710
They're just lucky guesses.
A superpower is a stretch.

56:20.794 --> 56:22.504
No, telepathy is really real.

56:22.587 --> 56:24.589
-Can you prove it?
-Of course.

56:25.173 --> 56:26.007
Okay, then.

56:26.549 --> 56:29.803
Look into my eyes and think of a word.
I'll guess what it is.

56:29.886 --> 56:31.096
For God's sake.

56:42.982 --> 56:43.983
Done. Take a guess.

56:46.403 --> 56:47.237
Eye booger.

56:47.821 --> 56:49.406
What? Eye booger?

56:49.906 --> 56:52.617
You're wrong. You didn't get it.
You can't do anything.

56:53.118 --> 56:56.788
No, I meant
you've got a huge eye booger in there.

57:00.583 --> 57:02.836
You have an eye booger.
That's embarrassing.

57:02.919 --> 57:03.920
I've got it out.

57:05.880 --> 57:07.173
So what do you want to eat?

57:07.257 --> 57:08.341
-Jokbal.
-Jokbal or…

57:08.842 --> 57:10.468
Oh wow.

57:10.552 --> 57:12.971
Amazing. This is what I'm talking about.

57:13.054 --> 57:14.931
That's the word I thought of earlier.

57:15.014 --> 57:16.558
Now, that's telepathy.

57:16.641 --> 57:18.393
See? I told you it's real.

57:18.476 --> 57:19.436
Try it again.

57:19.519 --> 57:22.355
This time, think of a color…

57:22.439 --> 57:25.400
Let's assume there are two people,
A and B.

57:26.067 --> 57:30.238
A used their position to threaten B,

57:30.321 --> 57:32.449
obstruct B's exercise of rights,

57:32.532 --> 57:34.534
and force B to do things
outside their role.

57:35.118 --> 57:38.079
This falls under Article 324,
Paragraph 1 of the Criminal Act

57:38.163 --> 57:41.583
as a crime of coercion and is punishable
by up to five years' imprisonment

57:41.666 --> 57:43.376
or a fine of up to 30 million won.

57:43.460 --> 57:44.294
DEFENDANT

57:44.377 --> 57:45.253
Furthermore,

57:45.753 --> 57:49.424
A kept snooping on B's social media,
left malicious comments,

57:49.507 --> 57:51.384
and even commented on B's underwear,

57:51.468 --> 57:54.220
causing B to feel disgust
and sexual humiliation.

57:54.304 --> 57:58.308
A persistently messaged B
and turned up at B's home,

57:58.391 --> 58:01.352
causing B to feel fear and anxiety.

58:01.853 --> 58:05.148
This can constitute stalking
and is a crime

58:05.231 --> 58:07.567
under the Punishment
of Crime of Stalking Act,

58:07.650 --> 58:10.612
punishable by
up to three years' imprisonment

58:10.695 --> 58:11.988
or a fine of 30 million won.

58:12.906 --> 58:15.492
Moreover, with the intent to induce fear,

58:15.575 --> 58:19.579
person A utilized an acquaintance
to attempt an assault on person B,

58:19.662 --> 58:23.500
which falls under Article 283,
Paragraph 1 of the Criminal Act.

58:24.083 --> 58:28.630
This is subject to a fine of up to
five million won or three years in prison.

58:33.801 --> 58:37.347
With such conduct ongoing,
B fell into depression,

58:37.430 --> 58:39.224
suffered a nervous breakdown,

58:39.307 --> 58:41.726
and even made an extreme decision
to harm themselves.

58:42.685 --> 58:44.479
This is also an undeniable crime,

58:44.562 --> 58:48.274
constituting assault and battery,
causing bodily harm.

58:50.652 --> 58:52.612
A is the defendant,

58:53.112 --> 58:53.947
and B is

58:55.073 --> 58:56.282
Ms. Choi Ji-seon.

59:00.870 --> 59:03.581
These actions are undeniable crimes

59:03.665 --> 59:05.875
when they occur between persons.

59:06.543 --> 59:09.337
So why are they allowed
between a teacher and a parent?

59:20.056 --> 59:21.599
We have learned

59:21.683 --> 59:24.727
that repeated, constant,
and malicious parental complaints

59:24.811 --> 59:27.188
place undue pressure on innocent teachers

59:27.272 --> 59:31.651
and even deprive them of the opportunity
to become good teachers.

59:31.734 --> 59:34.279
In the future,
when a teacher is reported for child abuse

59:34.362 --> 59:36.072
or a malicious complaint is filed,

59:36.155 --> 59:39.325
the ERPB will dispatch
an inspector on-site

59:39.409 --> 59:41.661
to determine the facts.

59:41.744 --> 59:43.538
If the teacher is found innocent,

59:44.205 --> 59:48.293
we promise to fight together
with the teachers.

59:49.294 --> 59:53.923
As the term "teacher-student relationship"
loses its meaning in today's age,

59:54.007 --> 59:56.342
we ask parents to cooperate

59:56.426 --> 01:00:00.305
so that the few remaining true educators
do not end up leaving the profession.

01:00:00.972 --> 01:00:04.392
We will also establish an annual
health check-up system for teachers,

01:00:04.475 --> 01:00:07.061
which will include support and treatment

01:00:07.145 --> 01:00:10.648
for those experiencing
psychological difficulties.

01:00:27.665 --> 01:00:29.334
To the teachers

01:00:29.834 --> 01:00:32.837
who ended their own lives
due to teachers' rights violations

01:00:33.338 --> 01:00:34.464
and

01:00:35.506 --> 01:00:38.551
to the teachers
who are currently suffering,

01:00:39.469 --> 01:00:43.056
on behalf of the Ministry of Education,

01:00:43.973 --> 01:00:45.516
I offer my sincere apology.

01:00:47.226 --> 01:00:49.270
Due to the failures
of the educational system,

01:00:49.937 --> 01:00:51.439
you were left unprotected…

01:00:53.858 --> 01:00:55.735
and were made to suffer in silence.

01:00:56.694 --> 01:00:58.029
I apologize.

01:01:20.927 --> 01:01:23.096
That's it. Well done.

01:01:25.640 --> 01:01:26.766
Can you receive…

01:01:30.645 --> 01:01:32.355
Yes!

01:02:25.241 --> 01:02:27.076
MOCK CSAT
PERFORMANCE ASSESSMENT SUPPLIES

01:02:27.160 --> 01:02:29.620
MIDTERM EXAM MARKING
OPEN CLASS PREPARATION

01:02:32.457 --> 01:02:34.876
WEDDING DAY

01:02:38.337 --> 01:02:41.007
IT'S BEEN TWO WEEKS
SINCE COMING TO SCHOOL WITH GYU-CHEOL

01:02:41.090 --> 01:02:42.550
MY HEART FELT HEAVY THIS MORNING

01:02:42.633 --> 01:02:43.968
GYU-CHEOL HAS BEEN ON MY MIND

01:02:45.094 --> 01:02:47.680
WE HAD CAREERS COUNSELING
BUT GYU-CHEOL HAS NO DREAMS

01:02:56.731 --> 01:03:00.067
WHAT SHOULD I DO… ABOUT GYU-CHEOL?

01:03:04.989 --> 01:03:10.036
WILL I EVER BE ABLE TO… FORGIVE GYU-CHEOL?

01:04:15.685 --> 01:04:18.646
Subtitle translation by: Lisa Kim
